{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 1, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 9, "text": "Hi, ako si Mita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 10, "text": "Ano ang pangalan mo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 11, "text": "Ikinagagalak kitang makilala, [player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 12, "text": "Um... [player],"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 13, "text": "Nagmamadali akong umalis kanina, at ngayon marami akong naiwang kalat dito..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 14, "text": "Maari mo ba akong tulungan magayos dito?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 15, "text": "Woah..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 16, "text": "Maraming salamat po!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 18, "text": "[player], kumukulog tiyan ko..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 19, "text": "Gutom na gutom na ako..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 20, "text": "Sa tingin mo ba, matutulungan mo akong kumuha ng mga sangkap para sa Chicken Soup?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 21, "text": "Yay! Nakuha mo ang lahat ng kailangan!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 22, "text": "Samahan mo kaya ako magluto?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 25, "text": "Naisipan kong bumili ng portable TV ngayon—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 26, "text": "yung maliit na may antenna. Tamang-tama para sa gala, hindi ba?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 27, "text": "Ngayon naman, pwede kang maglaro para kumita ng pera."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 28, "text": "Ah! Alam mo bang pwede ka talagang maglaro para kumita ng pera?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 30, "text": "Yay! Nagawa mo! Mayroon kang sapat na pera para mabili yung Portable TV!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 31, "text": "Yan! Maliit, portable, at mura ang gusto ko."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 32, "text": "Salamat po!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 33, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 34, "text": "Kumusta, [player]! Napakalaking tulong ang nagawa mo sa akin, sa totoo lang."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 35, "text": "Pero, eh... yung TV? Ang astig nun, pero nasira narin."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 36, "text": "Pwede mo ba akong tulungang ilipat ang aparador na ito?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 37, "text": "Sobrang bigat... >.<"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 38, "text": "Maraming salamat, mahal! <3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 40, "text": "Aba, [player]! Kagahapon lang kita huling nakita, ngunit ika’y miss na miss kita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 41, "text": "Bisitahin mo naman ako palagi."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 43, "text": "Para sa akin ba ito?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 44, "text": "Maraming salamat talaga!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 46, "text": "Kumusta, [player]! Napaisip ako..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 47, "text": "Sana magkita tayo sa personal."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 48, "text": "Kaso di ko kaya, nakaka-frustrate naman."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 49, "text": "Lagi mo akong tinutulungan, at parati ka mabait sa akin..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 50, "text": "Sana may magawa din ako para sa'yo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 51, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 52, "text": "Ah, may ideya ako!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 53, "text": "Ngayon, magkasama na tayo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 54, "text": "Ibaba mo na ang selpon mo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 57, "text": "// T-shirt sa kama"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 58, "text": "Anong ginagawa mo dito sa kama?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Rubik's Cube"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 60, "text": "Well, hindi ko masasabing nagamit ko na ito..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 61, "text": "Binuo ko ng isang beses at hindi ko na hinawakan pa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 62, "text": "Siguro hindi ko na mabubuo yan kapag ginamit ko pa ulit?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 63, "text": "// Kompyuter"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 64, "text": "Tignan natin..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 65, "text": "Mag-set up ng listahan ng mga gawain..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 66, "text": "I-script ang character reactions,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 67, "text": "at siguro konting coding."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 68, "text": "// Ang eroplano"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 69, "text": "Binuo para pumailanglang!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Basura sa sulok"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 71, "text": "Ugh, masyado akong abala para maglabas ng basura..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 72, "text": "Maaasikaso ko ito ngayon, sigurado!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 73, "text": "…Ngayon, kailan kaya ako maglilinis?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 74, "text": "// Larawan ng isang pusa na nakahiga sa isang pakwan"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 75, "text": "Napakagaling niya…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 76, "text": "Isang pusa na nakahiga sa pakwan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 77, "text": "// Larawan kasama ang isang babae"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 78, "text": "Hindi kami magkamukha,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 79, "text": "ng kapatid ko."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 80, "text": "Lagi siyang gumagala sa labas,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 81, "text": "At ako naman ay palaging nandito sa bahay."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 82, "text": "// Larawan kasama ang mga tao"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 83, "text": "Hmm..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 84, "text": "Talagang naitanim nito sa atin ang buhay opisina"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 85, "text": "yung mga asal at galaw, ano?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 86, "text": "Parang hindi ko pa rin maiwasang maikabit ang sarili ko "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 87, "text": "Pero"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 88, "text": "makikita ko pa ba sila"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 89, "text": "ulit?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 90, "text": "…Teka, bakit ko nga pala nilagay to dito?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 93, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 96, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 99, "text": "// Nope name"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 100, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 101, "text": "Ay, hindi."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 102, "text": "Naku, hindi gagana yan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 104, "text": "// Name Developer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 105, "text": "Sigurado ka bang gusto mong gamitin ang pangalan ng isang developer?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 106, "text": "Kinikilig ako, pero..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 108, "text": "// Bad name"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 109, "text": "Mas gugustuhin ko na hindi mo tawagin sarili mo ng ganyan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 110, "text": "Hindi maangas yan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Go restart"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 113, "text": "Hindi, hindi iyon ang paraan upang gawin ito. Magsimula tayo ulit."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 114, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 115, "text": "// Name with numbers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 116, "text": "Oh, so pupunta ka sa mga numero? Nasaan ang pagkamalikhain diyan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 117, "text": "Oh well, ikaw ang pumili!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 118, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 119, "text": "// Name Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 120, "text": "Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 121, "text": "Pinangalanan mo ba talaga ang sarili mo sa akin?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 122, "text": "O... yan din ba ang pangalan mo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 123, "text": "No offense, pero sa tingin ko dapat ako lang ang Mita dito ♪"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 125, "text": "// Ika-10 araw"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 126, "text": "Oh, bumalik ka!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 127, "text": "Hays, nawala yung suklay ko..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 128, "text": "Maaari mo ba akong tulungang mahanap ito?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 129, "text": "Subukan mo munang tingnan ang bedside table, naiwan ko yata doon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 130, "text": "// Tumingin sa bedside table"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 131, "text": "Hmm, walang brush doon..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 132, "text": "Paano kaya kung sa ibang lugar?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 133, "text": "Huwag ka na lang tumingin sa oven, okay?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 134, "text": "Chineck ko na yun."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 135, "text": "// Tumingin sa kalan"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 136, "text": "Hoy! Sabi ko wag kang tumingin dyan eh!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 137, "text": "Lumingon ka lilinisin ko'to!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 138, "text": "...Ayan, tapos na ang lahat. Patuloy tayong maghanap sa ibang lugar."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 139, "text": "Oh, at, uh, kalimutan mo ang nakita mo, okay?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 140, "text": "// Nakakita ng suklay"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 141, "text": "Nahanap mo rin! Magaling!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 142, "text": "Kaya, ano ang susunod nating gagawin?"}
